| **`strong-typing.mdc`** | Annotations, validated boundaries |
| **`logging-loguru.mdc`** | `get_logger`, structured JSON, inference correlation ID |
| **`python-tooling.mdc`** | Black, Ruff, pyright, import-linter, Makefile; **Python 3.11+** |

